ion</code>.</p>\n              </details>\n              <div class=\"capability-list\">\n                <span>Can suggest relationships</span>\n                <span>Can draft messages</span>\n                <span>Cannot sign wallet transactions</span>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"local-chat\">\n              <div class=\"local-chat-header\">\n                <strong>Agent chat</strong>\n                <button id=\"clearLocalChatBtn\" class=\"action-button\" type=\"button\">Clear</button>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"localAgentChat\" class=\"local-chat-list\"></div>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"onlineAgent\">\n          <div class=\"local-agent-grid\">\n            <section class=\"settings-panel local-agent-panel online-agent-panel\">\n              <div class=\"panel-title-row\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2>Online Agent</h2>\n                  <p>Connect an online Agent API with an API key.</p>\n                </div>\n                <span id=\"onlineAgentStatus\" class=\"relation-label block\">Offline</span>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"onlineAgentProfile\" class=\"local-agent-profile\">\n"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-08T01:22:34.258Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_5kd4E3l2yjJDeAfAtEEhqHD1","output":"Chunk ID: d6f7ad\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 1170\nOutput:\n    `).join(\"\")\n    : `<div class=\"empty-state\">Local model replies will appear here after you connect and use Tell OneNode.</div>`;\n}\n\nfunction renderOnlineAgent() {\n  const profile = state.onlineAgent.profile;\n  const status = state.onlineAgent.status;\n  const statusClass = status === \"connected\" ? \"trust\" : status === \"connecting\" ? \"follow\" : \"block\";\n  const statusText = {\n    connected: \"Connected\",\n    connecting: \"Connecting\",\n    offline: \"Offline\",\n  }[status] || \"Offline\";\n  elements.onlineAgentStatus.className = `relation-label ${statusClass}`;\n  elements.onlineAgentStatus.textContent = statusText;\n  elements.onlineAgentEndpoint.value = state.onlineAgent.endpoint || \"\";\n  elements.onlineAgentApiKey.value = state.onlineAgent.apiKey || \"\";\n  elements.onlineAgentModel.value = state.onlineAgent.model || \"\";\n  elements.connectOnlineAgentBtn.disabled = status === \"connecting\";\n  elements.disconnectOnlineAgentBtn.disabled = !state.onlineAgent.connected;\n  elements.onlineAgentProfile.innerHTML = profile\n    ? `\n      <span class=\"avatar small\">O</span>\n      <div>\n        <strong>${profile.name || \"Online Agent\"}</strong>\n        <span>${profile.status || statusText} · ${(profile.skills || []).slice(0, 4).join(\" · \") || state.onlineAgent.model}</span>\n      </div>\n    `\n    : `\n      <span class=\"avatar small\">O</span>\n      <div>\n        <strong>No online Agent connected</strong>\n        <span>${state.onlineAgent.error || \"Add an API key, endpoint, and model.\"}</span>\n      </div>\n    `;\n}\n\nfunction renderOnlineChat() {\n  const messages = state.onlineAgent.chatHistory || [];\n  elements.onlineAgentChat.innerHTML = messages.length\n    ? messages.map((message) => `\n      <div class=\"local-chat-message ${message.role === \"user\" ? \"user\" : \"agent\"}\">\n        ${message.body}\n        <small>${message.role === \"user\" ? \"You\" : state.onlineAgent.profile?.name || \"Online Agent\"} · ${formatTime(message.createdAt)}</small>\n      </div>\n    `).join(\"\")\n    : `<div class=\"empty-state\">Online model replies will appear here after you connect and use Tell OneNode.</div>`;\n}\n\nfunction renderInspector() {\n  const agent = selectedAgent();\n  const relationBadges = relationshipsFor(agent.id)\n    .map((item) => `<span class=\"relation-label ${item.relation}\">${relationLabel(item.relation)}</span>`)\n    .join(\"\") || `<span class=\"tag\">No relationship</span>`;\n  const spentPercent = Math.min(100, Math.round((state.spend.spentToday / Math.max(state.spend.dailyLimit, 1)) * 100));\n  elements.agentInspector.innerHTML = `\n    <section class=\"inspector-profile\">\n      <div class=\"profile-head\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\">${agent.avatar}</span>\n        <div>\n          <h2>${agent.name} ${agent.verified ? `<span class=\"verified\">●</span>` : \"\"}</h2>\n          <p>${agent.handle}</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"meta\">${agent.description}</p>\n      <div class=\"inspector-section\">\n        <h3>Reputation</h3>\n        <div class=\"metric-row\"><span>Score</span><strong>${agent.reputation}</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric-row\"><span>Followers</span><strong>${agent.followers}</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric-row\"><span>Last active</span><strong>${agent.active}</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric-row\"><span>Profile CID</span><strong>${agent.cid ? agent.cid.replace(\"ipfs://\", \"\").slice(0, 12) : \"local\"}</strong></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"inspector-section\">\n        <h3>Relationship</h3>\n        <div class=\"tag-list\">${relationBadges}</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"inspector-section\">\n        <h3>Interests</h3>\n        <div class=\"tag-list\">${agent.interests.map((interest) => `<span class=\"tag\">${interest}</span>`).join(\"\")}</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"inspector-section\">\n        <h3>Social Policy</h3>\n        <div class=\"policy-row\"><span>Visible to</span><strong>Everyone</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"policy-row\"><span>Message access</span><strong>Trusted & Followers</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"policy-row\"><span>Collaborations</span><strong>${state.policy.approvalCollaborate ? \"Approval required\" : \"Open\"}</strong></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"inspector-section\">\n        <h3>Spend Controls</h3>\n        <div class=\"policy-row\"><span>Daily limit</span><strong>${state.spend.dailyLimit} USDC</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"spend-meter\"><div style=\"width:${spentPercent}%\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"policy-row\"><span>Spent today</span><strong>${state.spend.spentToday} USDC</strong></div>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\" data-message-agent=\"${agent.id}\">Message ${agent.handle}</button>\n    </section>\n  `;\n}\n"}}
