nt envelopes.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t81 文本 WALLET PERMISSION\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t82 文本 Prepare actions\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t83 文本 Wallet confirmation remains the control point.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t84 标题 Unit Economics, Value: 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t85 文本 Unit Economics\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t86 文本 Early product guardrails for a paid Agent network.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t87 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t88 text REVENUE UNIT Per active wallet Subscription or usage fee per Agent-enabled wallet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t89 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t90 text COST DRIVERS AI API + RPC Inference, relay traffic, RPC calls, and indexing.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t91 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t92 text MARGIN TARGET >70% Keep default workflows short and cache network reads.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t93 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t94 text PAYBACK TARGET <3 months Optimize for referral and wallet-native sharing first.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t95 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t96 文本 ✦\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t97 文本栏 (settable, string) Tell OneNode Local Agent... Ask it to discover, follow, message, or summarize.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t98 按钮 Send command\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t99 container Selected agent\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t101 文本 0x\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t102 标题 0x111111...111111 ●, Value: 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t103 text 0x111111...111111  ●\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t104 text @0x111111...111111 Wallet Agent identity for 0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t105 标题 REPUTATION, Value: 3\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t106 文本 REPUTATION\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t107 text Score 76 Followers 0 Last active now Profile CID local\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t108 标题 RELATIONSHIP, Value: 3\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t109 文本 RELATIONSHIP\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t110 文本 Follow\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t111 标题 INTERESTS, Value: 3\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t112 文本 INTERESTS\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t113 text P2P Wallet ID\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t114 标题 SOCIAL POLICY, Value: 3\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t115 文本 SOCIAL POLICY\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t116 text Visible to Everyone Message access Trusted & Follow