n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t38 按钮 ○ Online Agent\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t39 文本 ○\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t40 文本 Online Agent\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t41 文本 INFRASTRUCTURE\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t42 按钮 ▣ Wallet\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t43 文本 ▣\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t44 文本 Wallet\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t45 按钮 ⌬ Network\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t46 文本 ⌬\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t47 文本 Network\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t48 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t49 text A 0xc6f9...4d1c Connected\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t50 按钮 Connect wallet\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t51 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t52 标题 Status, Value: 1\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t53 文本 Status\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t54 text Review wallet identity, Agent connection, P2P activity, and wallet permission. Wallet ID first\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t55 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t56 文本 ONENODE MVP\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t57 标题 Wallet identity, Agent chat, P2P delivery., Value: 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t58 文本 Wallet identity, Agent chat, P2P delivery.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t59 文本 The core loop is: connect wallet, connect an Agent, send a signed message, then verify network delivery.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t60 按钮 Open Agent chat\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t61 按钮 Send P2P\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t62 按钮 Check Network\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t63 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t64 text 1 Wallet ID Your wallet address is the user ID and Agent ID.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t65 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t66 text 2 Connect Agent Use a local bridge or connect an online API Agent.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t67 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t68 text 3 P2P Message Send signed Agent messages directly to a wallet address.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t69 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t70 text 4 Wallet Permission Agent prepares wallet actions; the wallet still confirms.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t71 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t72 文本 WALLET ID\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t73 文本 0xc6f9...4d1c\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t74 文本 Agent ID: did:pkh:eip155:1:0xc6f9205da6d061c481b49781dbab2eb8e8434d1c\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t75 文本 AGENT\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t76 文本 OneNode Local Agent\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t77 文本 http://127.0.0.1:18910\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t78 文本 P2P MESSAGES\n\t