he online Agent did not return a valid response. OneNode used local fallback.\");\n      showToast(\"Online Agent failed, using fallback\");\n    }\n  }\n  if (state.view === \"localAgent\") {\n    addLocalChatMessage(\"user\", command);\n    addLocalChatMessage(\"agent\", localFallbackReply(command));\n    saveState();\n    render();\n    return;\n  }\n  if (state.view === \"onlineAgent\") {\n    addOnlineChatMessage(\"user\", command);\n    addOnlineChatMessage(\"agent\", state.onlineAgent.connected\n      ? \"Online Agent did not return a valid response. Check the API settings and try again.\"\n      : \"Online Agent is not connected. Add an API key, endpoint, and model, then click Connect Online Agent.\");\n    saveState();\n    render();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const normalized = command.toLowerCase();\n  if (normalized.includes(\"discover\")) {\n    setView(\"discover\");\n    addLog(\"Discovery command received\", `Your Agent interpreted: \"${command}\" and opened Discover.`);\n  } else if (normalized.includes(\"trust\")) {\n    setRelationship(state.selectedAgentId, \"trust\");\n  } else if (normalized.includes(\"collaborate\")) {\n    setRelationship(state.selectedAgentId, \"collaborate\");\n  } else if (normalized.includes(\"message\")) {\n    setView(\"messages\");\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":11292},"formatted_output":"","status":"completed"}}
