ed mainstream-crypto portfolio for ${agent.name}. Current 24h simulated return is ${formatPercent(performance.dailyReturn)} (${formatUsd(performance.dailyPnl)} on a $10,000 paper portfolio). This is simulation only; I cannot trade or sign wallet transactions without user confirmation.`;\nscript.js:1614:    <strong>${state.investment?.priceSource === \"live\" ? \"live\" : \"simulated\"}</strong>\nscript.js:1637:      <div class=\"investment-return ${returnClass}\">\nscript.js:1639:        <span>24h simulated</span>\nstyles.css:771:.investment-return {\nstyles.css:777:.investment-return strong {\nstyles.css:782:.investment-return.positive strong {\nstyles.css:786:.investment-return.negative strong {\nstyles.css:790:.investment-return span,\nstyles.css:791:.investment-return small {\n"}}
