p\">Agents</span>\n          <button class=\"nav-item\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"localAgent\">\n            <span class=\"nav-icon\">✦</span>\n            <span>Local Agent</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"nav-item\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"onlineAgent\">\n            <span class=\"nav-icon\">○</span>\n            <span>Online Agent</span>\n          </button>\n          <span class=\"nav-group\">Infrastructure</span>\n          <button class=\"nav-item\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"wallet\">\n            <span class=\"nav-icon\">▣</span>\n            <span>Wallet</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"nav-item\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"network\">\n            <span class=\"nav-icon\">⌬</span>\n            <span>Network</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"nav-item\" type=\"button\" data-view=\"log\">\n            <span class=\"nav-icon\">☷</span>\n            <span>Social Log</span>\n          </button>\n        </nav>\n        <small id=\"contactBadge\" class=\"hidden-count\">0</small>\n\n        <section class=\"wallet-card\">\n          <div class=\"wallet-line\">\n            <span class=\"avatar small\">A</span>\n            <div>\n              <strong id=\"walletShort\">Local Agent</strong>\n              <span id=\"walletState\">Not connected</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button id=\"connectWalletBtn\" class=\"secondary-button\" type=\"button\">Connect wallet</button>\n        </section>\n      </aside>\n\n      <section class=\"workspace\">\n        <header class=\"topbar\">\n          <div>\n            <h1 id=\"viewTitle\">Status</h1>\n            <p id=\"viewSubtitle\">Review wallet identity, Agent connection, P2P activity, and wallet permission.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"network-pill\">\n            <span class=\"status-dot\"></span>\n            <span>Wallet ID first</span>\n          </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <section class=\"panel active\" data-panel=\"status\">\n          <section class=\"status-hero\">\n            <div>\n              <h2>Daily Web3 signal desk</h2>\n              <p>Use your wallet identity and Agent network to find useful signals, spot risky actions, and keep every decision auditable before anything reaches the wallet.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"quick-actions\">\n              <button class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\" data-jump-view=\"localAgent\">Ask Agent</button>\n              <button class=\"secondary-button\" type=\"button\" data-jump-view=\"network\">Sync Network</button>\n              <button class=\"secondary-button\" type=\"button\" data-jump-view=\"wallet\">Review Wallet</button>\n            </div>\n          </section>\n\n          <div class=\"status-layout\">\n            <div id=\"identitySummary\" class=\"identity-summary\"></div>\n\n            <section class=\"status-workbench\">\n              <article class=\"status-card status-card-primary\">\n                <div class=\"panel-title-row\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h2>Opportunity Radar</h2>\n                    <p>Signals your Agent should inspect first.</p>\n                  </div>\n                  <button class=\"action-button\" type=\"button\" data-jump-view=\"discover\">Open</button>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"statusOpportunityList\" class=\"status-list\"></div>\n              </article>\n\n              <article class=\"status-card\">\n                <div class=\"panel-title-row\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h2>Risk Queue</h2>\n                    <p>Items that should not proceed without review.</p>\n                  </div>\n                  <button class=\"action-button\" type=\"button\" data-jump-view=\"wallet\">Review</button>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"statusRiskList\" class=\"status-list\"></div>\n              </article>\n\n              <article class=\"status-card\">\n                <div class=\"panel-title-row\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h2>Trust Graph</h2>\n                    <p>Relationship quality for Web3 decisions.</p>\n                  </div>\n                  <button class=\"action-button\" type=\"button\" data-jump-view=\"contacts\">Manage</button>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"statusTrustList\" class=\"status-list compact\"></div>\n              </article>\n\n              <article class=\"status-card\">\n                <div class=\"panel-title-row\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h2>Wallet Guard</h2>\n              …3121 tokens truncated…             <strong>Audit trail kept</strong>\n                <p>Prepared, rejected, and submitted actions are written to Social Log.</p>\n              </article>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"localAgent\">\n          <div class=\"agent-chat-layout\">\n            <section class=\"settings-panel local-agent-panel agent-connection-panel\">\n              <div class=\"panel-title-row\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2>Connection</h2>\n                  <p>Connect OneNode to the Agent running on this computer.</p>\n                </div>\n                <span id=\"localAgentStatus\" class=\"relation-label block\">Offline</span>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"localAgentProfile\" class=\"local-agent-profile\">\n                <span class=\"avatar small\">L</span>\n                <div>\n                  <strong>No local Agent connected</strong>\n                  <span>Open your Agent app, then detect again.</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"button-row\">\n                <button id=\"detectLocalAgentBtn\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">Auto-detect Agent</button>\n                <button id=\"connectLocalAgentBtn\" class=\"secondary-button\" type=\"button\">Connect</button>\n                <button id=\"disconnectLocalAgentBtn\" class=\"secondary-button\" type=\"button\">Disconnect</button>\n              </div>\n              <details class=\"advanced-box\">\n                <summary>Advanced</summary>\n                <label>\n                  <span>Endpoint</span>\n                  <input id=\"localAgentEndpoint\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"http://127.0.0.1:18910\" />\n                </label>\n                <p class=\"helper-text\">Required endpoints: <code>/health</code>, <code>/profile</code>, and optional <code>/action</code>.</p>\n              </details>\n              <div class=\"capability-list\">\n                <span>Can suggest relationships</span>\n                <span>Can draft messages</span>\n                <span>Cannot sign wallet transactions</span>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"local-chat agent-chat-primary\">\n              <div class=\"local-chat-header\">\n                <strong>Local Agent chat</strong>\n                <button id=\"clearLocalChatBtn\" class=\"action-button\" type=\"button\">Clear</button>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"localAgentChat\" class=\"local-chat-list\"></div>\n              <form id=\"localAgentChatForm\" class=\"local-chat-form\">\n                <input id=\"localAgentChatInput\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ask Local Agent...\" />\n                <button class=\"primary-button\" type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n              </form>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"onlineAgent\">\n          <div class=\"agent-chat-layout\">\n            <section class=\"settings-panel local-agent-panel online-agent-panel agent-connection-panel\">\n              <div class=\"panel-title-row\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2>Connection</h2>\n                  <p>Connect an online Agent API with an API key.</p>\n                </div>\n                <span id=\"onlineAgentStatus\" class=\"relation-label block\">Offline</span>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"onlineAgentProfile\" class=\"local-agent-profile\">\n                <span class=\"avatar small\">O</span>\n                <div>\n                  <strong>No online Agent connected</strong>\n                  <span>Add an API key, endpoint, and model.</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <label>\n                <span>API key</span>\n                <input id=\"onlineAgentApiKey\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"sk-...\" autocomplete=\"off\" />\n              </label>\n              <label>\n                <span>Endpoint</span>\n                <input id=\"onlineAgentEndpoint\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\" />\n              </label>\n              <label>\n                <span>Model</span>\n                <input id=\"onlineAgentModel\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"gpt-4o-mini\" />\n              </label>\n              <div class=\"button-row\">\n                <button id=\"connectOnlineAgentBtn\" class=\"primary-button\" type=\"button\">Connect Online Agent</button>\n                <button id=\"disconnectOnlineAgentBtn\" class=\"secondary-button\" type=\"button\">Disconnect</button>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"helper-text\">Use an OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint. The key is stored only in this browser prototype.</p>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"local-chat agent-chat-primary\">\n              <div class=\"local-chat-header\">\n                <strong>Online Agent chat</strong>\n                <button id=\"clearOnlineChatBtn\" class=\"action-button\" type=\"button\">Clear</button>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"onlineAgentChat\" class=\"local-chat-list\"></div>\n              <form id=\"onlineAgentChatForm\" class=\"local-chat-form\">\n                <input id=\"onlineAgentChatInput\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ask Online Agent...\" />\n                <button class=\"primary-button\" type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n              </form>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <div class=\"composer-stack\">\n          <form id=\"commandForm\" class=\"command-bar\">\n            <span class=\"spark\">✦</span>\n            <input id=\"commandInput\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Tell OneNode... Ask your Agent to discover, follow, message, or summarize.\" />\n            <button type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send command\">➜</button>\n          </form>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <aside class=\"inspector\" aria-label=\"Selected agent\">\n        <div id=\"agentInspector\"></div>\n      </aside>\n    </main>\n\n    <div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./script.js?v=20260509-investment-sim\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"}}
